# nothing is sacrificed and the 7/5 connects.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Sol Ring
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Bebop & Rocksteady
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

